<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Sonae to expand shops network.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Sonae to expand shops network.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese retail group Sonae Investimentos plans to invest 58 billion escudos over the next four years to open 252 new shops in Portugal, Spain and Britain, a senior company official was quoted as saying.</p>
<p>&quot;Sonae's plan foresees the opening of 65 new units in Portugal, 176 in Spain and 11 in London,&quot; Carlos Moreira da Silva, head of Sonae's specialised retail subsidiary, told weekly Expresso newspaper, published over the weekend.</p>
<p>The new shops would include home decoration stores. Moreira da Silva gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
